+#
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
+#
+# DADAO machine header hook.
+#
+# picolibc's per-architecture `machine/` subdirectory overrides the generic
+# <machine/fenv.h> / <machine/math.h> / <machine/_fpmath.h> when an
+# architecture needs different definitions.  DADAO does not: `long double` is
+# 64-bit IEEE-754 binary64 (identical to `double`), so the generic float-math
+# paths are already correct and nothing needs to be installed here.  The
+# directory exists as the arch hook the picolibc build layout expects.
+#
